r;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">04</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 11.8576%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">02</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0Education\u00a0 Qualification\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates having Master Degree in MCA, M.Tech (with specialisation in Computer Application) from any recognized university along with having will be eligible for this post. Or</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates having Degree in B.Tech in CSE or Computer science or Computer Technology from a recognised University or Institute.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>(i)</strong> Candidates having Degree in BCA or Computer Science or Electronics or Electronics and Communication Engineering from a recognised University.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>(ii)</strong> 02 years experience in electronic data processing work including experience of actual programming from a recognised institute or from Offices of Central Government or State Government or Union Territories or Autonomous or Statutory organization or public sector undertakings or Universities or Recognized Research Institute.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Desirable Qualification :</strong> Knowledge of programming in C, C Plus, Or Visual C plus plus and in Oracle, Relation Data Base Management System to Experience on RISC based Computer Systems under UNIX or UNIX like Operating Systems or WINDOWS Networking or Windows environment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0How to Apply\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Interested candidates can apply through link provided below,<span style=\"color: #000000;\">\u00a0</span>or they can also apply through official site of the UPSC before 28/November/2024.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0Mode Of Selection\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Shortlisting of Candidates for Interview</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Personal Interview</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"><strong><strong><strong>SOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS</strong></strong></strong></h6>\n<script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-9762662687323163\" type=\"7db949d398c4c47b9eae86df-text/javascript\"></script>\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-9762662687323163\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7596594071\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display:block\"></ins>\n<script type=\"7db949d398c4c47b9eae86df-text/javascript\">\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\n</script>\n<div 